{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_schema_test_gate", "label": "Entity-Contract conformance gate (schema test in the generated application)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The schema test is an artifact OF the generated application: the archetype does not interpret contract or entity \u2014 it only materializes/removes the artifact by derived condition and verifies presence, absence, green execution and failure under sabotage, always running the test INSIDE the generated application, with zero new flags and zero new dependencies."}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_two_layer_test_package", "label": "Two-layer test package (fixed Velocity layer + flag-derived generator-04 layer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "10 fixed files by Velocity template and 17 flag-derived files by generator-04; ContractRoundTripTest is generated rather than fixed because its synthetic payload depends on the flag types \u2014 keeping it fixed would reintroduce the type inference the refactor removed (D13)."}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_reflection_comparison", "label": "Declared-field reflection comparison (bidirectional, recursive in nested types)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Class.getDeclaredFields() (never getters) makes the comparison immune to Lombok; the contract id maps to the technical <entity>Id (Long) and is always excluded from ENTITY_TO_CONTRACT; scaffold username/password are permitted only when the contract has no effective attributes (D12)."}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_round_trip_strict", "label": "Strict Jackson round-trip (FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_PROPERTIES=true)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A synthetic payload with Java names (id mapped to <entity>Id) enters and exits without losing a key, proving the saved contract and the generated model agree on every key; the payload is synthetic, so the archetype still never interprets contract values."}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_d9_sections_not_edited", "label": "D9 deviation: SECTIONS not edited for snippet-20", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SECTIONS only accepts body/ files plus dynamic markers; adding snippet-20 as a static entry would fail ComposerTest ('required body file missing') and duplicate the snippet since SNIPPETS expands the whole folder alphabetically \u2014 the requested position after generator-03 is already guaranteed by GENERATORS before SNIPPETS."}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_generator_03_contract_persistence", "label": "generator-03 contract persistence (byte-a-byte copy to src/test/resources/contracts/)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_lombok_parity_test", "label": "EntityContractLombokParityTest (gateFiles 10, Lombok on/off same verdict)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_fixturesmatrixtest_22", "label": "FixturesMatrixTest updated to 22 fixtures + signatures", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_readme_contracts_section", "label": "README 'Contratos' documentation section (FR-019..FR-023)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Simple language for two audiences (module users and archetype maintainers), six numbered items, no step-by-step tutorial; opens with the closed cycle DESENHO DA TELA to CONTRATO to MODULO DA API to TELA to make explicit that the check is not a mere conformance test."}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_golden_divergences", "label": "Golden divergences.txt (multiset comparison)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Captured before the refactor and compared as a multiset because surefire does not guarantee global order; the per-file order is verified separately; the corrupted-JSON scenario keeps a CONTRACT STRUCTURAL FAILURE prefix assertion because the parser message is volatile."}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_baby_step_sequence", "label": "Baby-step sequence C1-C8 (each step gated by 22/22 fixtures)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The refactor lands in eight gated steps \u2014 capture the golden first (C1), extract support classes with identical verdict (C2), add generator-04 alongside the old templates (C3), then flip (C4) \u2014 so the 22-fixture matrix plus sabotages stays green at every step and the offline full run (C8) is the final gate."}, {"id": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_spec003_llm_flag_inference", "label": "003-llm-flag-inference (archived spec, canonical flag-inference source)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "D10: the path src/main/pre-processamento-maven-flags-via-llm does not exist in the repository; the canonical sources for flag formation rules are specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference (research and data model) plus the regras-01..03 rule files."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_schema_test_gate", "target": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_two_layer_test_package", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_schema_test_gate", "target": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_reflection_comparison", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_schema_test_gate", "target": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_round_trip_strict", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/004-entity-contract-schema-test/plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_004_entity_contract_schema_test_plan_schema_test_gate"